    [
     1,
     "<span style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\">Hi folks,</span><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\">Just a friendly reminder the the R users’ group will be meeting tomorrow from 10-noon in the Data Lab classroom (360 Shields Library) and online. Join us with your trickiest R questions, or just come hang out and use the space for dedicated coding practice. If you join remotely, please post your questions to the discord site ahead of time. Relevant links below.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\">Best,</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\">Your <span style=\"background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24)\">D</span>-<span style=\"background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24)\">RUG</span> Coo[R]dinators</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\">_______________________________________</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-spacing:1px;border-color:rgb(49,49,49);color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\">The fall quaRter is upon us, which means we have a whole academic term of Davis R Users&#39; Group (<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>D</span></span>-<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>RUG</span></span>) to look forward to. This quarter, <span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>D</span></span>-<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>RUG</span></span> will be meeting from <b style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\">10am-noon on Wednesdays</b>. We will be meeting in a hybrid format, in 360 Shields Library (DataLab classroom) and on <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/92807937862\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(66,133,244)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/92807937862&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DXprWGc4JvzBwf6Yq-vv4\">Zoom</a>. You are cordially invited to attend in either venue.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\">This year, we are adopting a new queueing approach for virtual folks seeking help at <span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>D</span></span>-<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>RUG</span></span>. If you are joining virtually, we ask that you submit your question to <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(66,133,244)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YFK0ksKVbP1PA71140R00\">our Discourse site</a> in advance of our meetings, and we will address folks&#39; questions in the order they are received. Of course, you are always welcome (and encouraged) to just come hang out, and use the work group time as a dedicated chunk of time to get some coding done with good company.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><b style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\">For those not familiar with <span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>D</span></span>-<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>RUG</span></span></b>, the R Users&#39; Group is a weekly working group to get some help with R-specific coding problems. The coordinators are various and sundry coding connoisseurs, ranging from UCD data scientists to grad students on campus. We meet for 2 hours in an open-forum format, so you can treat <span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>D</span></span>-<span style=\"font-size:1rem;background-color:rgba(253,214,99,0.24);border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><span>RUG</span></span> as a communal, co-working environment: come hang out and chat, work on your own, seek help, make friends. Or, a little bit of everything! Check out our <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(66,133,244)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sXbNFa4VJ1d1s3W16dafp\">website</a> for more information.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\"><b style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(49,49,49)\">We are also seeking presenters!</b> It is nice to mix things up with occasional presentations. In the past, we&#39;ve had (15- to 45-minute) presentations ranging from data types, to tidyverse tools, to spatial data, to the Google Earth Engine plugin for R. If you would like to hone your teaching, need an excuse to perfect your cRaft, or want to show off a cool R trick you learned, shoot us an email and we can add your presentation to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/calendar.html\" style=\"font-size:1rem;border-color:rgb(66,133,244)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/calendar.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1IZey2qFUpgXPo5wEMkQui\">calendar</a>! Presentations can be in-person or virtual (and in-person presentations will be streamed for virtual attendees).</div></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Christian John — Ph.D. candidate</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">NASA FINESST Future Investigator</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Pronouns: he/him/his</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=VPd60tMAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;authuser=1&amp;sortby=pubdate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl%3Den%26user%3DVPd60tMAAAAJ%26view_op%3Dlist_works%26authuser%3D1%26sortby%3Dpubdate&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw236uDS2kpf99xbaGSt9k3R\">Google Scholar</a></div><div><a href=\"https://jepsonnomad.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jepsonnomad.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dspg4WaIpRXPV4p5wAU7v\">Christian&#39;s Website</a></div><div><br></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Graduate Group in Ecology</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Academic+Surge/@38.5352334,-121.7532526,19z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x808529101a2c2a05:0x437ec7ca5a00065!8m2!3d38.5352324!4d-121.7527041\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/maps/place/Academic%2BSurge/@38.5352334,-121.7532526,19z/data%3D!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x808529101a2c2a05:0x437ec7ca5a00065!8m2!3d38.5352324!4d-121.7527041&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465145802000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kwBiPq6yGLZbbT3SdVJvO\">Academic Surge Building</a>, Room 1324 <br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">University of California, Davis</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Davis, CA 95616</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
